direction: down

R: Tensor 申请 N bytes {
    style.bold: true
}
C: allocator 中有\n合适的 cached block? {
    shape: diamond
}
Reuse: 复用 cached block
Alloc: 向 CUDA 申请新 Segment {
    style.stroke: blue
}
Split: 从 Segment 中切出 block
Ret: 返回 block 给 Tensor {
    style.stroke: green
}
Free: Tensor 生命周期结束 {
    style.stroke: red
}
Mark: Block 标记为 free\n留在 allocator cache
TryMerge: 尝试与相邻 free block 合并

R -> C
C -> Reuse: 有
C -> Alloc: 没有
Alloc -> Split
Split -> Ret
Reuse -> Ret
Free -> Mark
Mark -> TryMerge
